# Canopy

Canopy is a green finance intelligence platform.

The project uses satellite imagery and AI to help monitor environmental change, verify sustainability projects, and generate climate-related insights.

## Project structure

canopy/
├── frontend/      # React web application
├── backend/       # FastAPI or Flask backend
├── geospatial/    # Satellite imagery and scientific pipeline
├── docs/          # Architecture, API notes, JSON schema
└── README.md
